    {
        "content": "<p>Example:<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/95fdbd69e13b7e6b08d6b2ea72cbb6dd26d0d5f8/Mathlib/Algebra/Algebra/Basic.lean#L216\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/95fdbd69e13b7e6b08d6b2ea72cbb6dd26d0d5f8/Mathlib/Algebra/Algebra/Basic.lean#L216</a></p>\n<p>Am I the only Lean user disturbed by the lack of parenthesis in front of the keyword <code>fun</code> as in...</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofModule</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">smul_mul_assoc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">smul_comm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symm</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I would find it much more pleasant to read with parentheses:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofModule</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">smul_mul_assoc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">smul_comm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">g</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symm</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>What are your opinions?</p>",
        "id": 607209845,
        "sender_full_name": "Martin Dvořák",
        "timestamp": 1782756055
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I've had my dose of parentheses with Lisp <span aria-label=\"no signal\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f645\" role=\"img\" title=\"no signal\">:no_signal:</span></p>\n<p>Think for a moment on the accumulation of right-side parentheses that would happen otherwise: <code>foo))) bar)) baz)</code></p>",
        "id": 607211020,
        "sender_full_name": "Arthur Paulino",
        "timestamp": 1782756456
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>What about here?<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/95fdbd69e13b7e6b08d6b2ea72cbb6dd26d0d5f8/Mathlib/Algebra/Algebra/Defs.lean#L238\">https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/95fdbd69e13b7e6b08d6b2ea72cbb6dd26d0d5f8/Mathlib/Algebra/Algebra/Defs.lean#L238</a><br>\nWould you add them even tho they aren't mandatory?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">ofModule'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">one_mul</span><span class=\"o\">])</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mul_one</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 607211938,
        "sender_full_name": "Martin Dvořák",
        "timestamp": 1782756800
    },
